# DNS configuration plan for bd-king-r7.com
# This is documentation, NOT an authoritative BIND zone file.
# Do not load it into named or publish a placeholder address.
# Replace ORIGIN_IPV4 only after confirming the real public VPS IPv4.

$ORIGIN bd-king-r7.com.
$TTL 3600

; Apex website address — configure in Cloudflare dashboard:
; @    IN A      ORIGIN_IPV4
; www  IN CNAME  bd-king-r7.com.

; Planned subdomains — publish only after their services are deployed:
; api   IN CNAME  bd-king-r7.com.
; admin IN CNAME  bd-king-r7.com.
; app   IN CNAME  bd-king-r7.com.

; Do not add MX/SPF/DKIM/DMARC until a mail provider is selected.
; DNSSEC DS records must exactly match the current Cloudflare zone values.
